WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.995
An effective oral description names a real Ghanaian place and accurately explains its

00:00:05.995 --> 00:00:08.669
location, notable features and cultural significance.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:14.413
Which question helps describe an event fully? Answer: Who took part and what did they

00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:14.739
do?

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:20.963
Present a short factual talk about one of Ghana's regions, identifying a place and a

00:00:20.963 --> 00:00:21.675
distinctive feature.

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:26.075
Why it works: Who and what identify participants and action.
